+CADSG Windows namespace adaptation for Codex 0.167
+-------------------------------------------------
+This source includes private-home Windows resource identity adaptations by the
+Codex App DeepSeek Gateway project, based on OpenAI Codex commit
+c40729ea5cf8e947481b130c59807273eda2f8e9. The original Codex LICENSE and notices
+remain applicable.
+
+The Windows filesystem ACL coordination modules acl_lock.rs and
+private_acl_lock.rs are reused without source changes from the published
+codex-deepseek-runtime 0.6.7 source, commit
+cb788738864e97a16cde82f3c584164162ab6f7c (Apache-2.0). Their exact helper-producer
+source bytes are recorded in the patch provenance/source map. The native ACL
+policy, token construction, execution loop, tools, approvals, and thread
+orchestration remain from the upstream Codex source. Reusing OS coordination
+does not import CDS launchers, supervisors, credentials, sessions, or runtime
+business logic.
+
+The adaptation changes native Windows resource labels and validates private
+home ownership. Its original and modified file hashes and source recipe are
+provided with the source patch. It does not redistribute the proprietary
+desktop App, ASAR, or publisher-signed runtime package.
